    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 1,
     "text": "Hard drives, data center platforms, NAS systems, and accessories from Western Digital for high-performance, high-capacity storage."
    },
    {
     "role": "cta",
     "order": 2,
     "text": "Discover our Full Portfolio",
     "href": "https://www.westerndigital.com/products/product-portfolio"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 3,
     "text": "Make space for new games and slash system load times for your favorite titles."
    },
    {
     "role": "cta",
     "order": 4,
     "text": "Learn More about Gaming Storage",
     "href": "/solutions/gaming"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 5,
     "text": "Storage that matches your specific needs for system performance, data redundancy, or both."
