     "order": 6,
     "text": "Learn More About RAID",
     "href": "/solutions/raid"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 7,
     "text": "Hard drives and enclosures that connect via Ethernet to help you access your data wherever you have an internet connection."
    },
    {
     "role": "cta",
     "order": 8,
     "text": "Learn About Network Attached Storage (NAS)",
     "href": "/solutions/network-attached-storage"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 9,
     "text": "HDD storage for recording, saving, and analyzing CCTV data from enterprise-grade surveillance systems."
    },
    {
     "role": "cta",
     "order": 10,
